        {
          "text": "Waan boch'ani mid'aasani kana tokole dura gajette inkad'atiini; wonti akanatiifi anini, AABBO Waaqi kanke, waan d'ibi na biraani kad'atani inoobsu. Anini ammalle nama jibbuufi d'aloota worraa ka sadeesotiifi ka afreesole gaargala itiini d'ufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
