              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ammo guyyaani torbeeso guyya Sabato ka AABBO Waaqa kanketiti. Guyya suni huji tokole inhojatiini, si taanaani, ijoolle tante taanaani, tissele tante taanaani, hori kanke taanaani, yokhaani keessuma tantele taanaani; guyya suni ooli. ",
