          "text": "Wonti akanatiifi AABBO Waaqi guyya jaa keesati gubba, lafa, galaanafi waan keesa jirale ch'ufa mid'aase, guyya torbeeso hafuura baafate. Tanaafi AABBO Waaqi Sabato eebise qulqullo tolche.",
